WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.281
He replaced the

00:00:01.093 --> 00:00:02.519
Mac Dock entirely

00:00:03.054 --> 00:00:04.657
John Siracusa spent

00:00:04.469 --> 00:00:05.365
three and a

00:00:05.177 --> 00:00:06.438
half months building

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.098
Jetty Pro

00:00:07.335 --> 00:00:08.171
a Mac app

00:00:07.983 --> 00:00:09.587
that creates customizable

00:00:09.398 --> 00:00:10.542
Dock-like floating

00:00:10.354 --> 00:00:11.462
palettes around the

00:00:11.285 --> 00:00:12.075
edges of your

00:00:11.887 --> 00:00:12.794
displays

00:00:13.318 --> 00:00:14.273
The palettes can

00:00:14.085 --> 00:00:15.098
hold files

00:00:15.169 --> 00:00:15.912
folders

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:16.702
volumes

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.353
apps Shortcuts and

00:00:18.424 --> 00:00:19.391
even the Trash

00:00:19.261 --> 00:00:19.933
and the app

00:00:19.745 --> 00:00:20.876
can simulate Dock

00:00:20.688 --> 00:00:22.233
backgrounds from macOS

00:00:22.044 --> 00:00:22.775
15

00:00:22.882 --> 00:00:24.945
26 and 27

00:00:25.478 --> 00:00:27.789
It costs 9.99 dollars

00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:28.437
per year as

00:00:28.249 --> 00:00:29.581
an introductory price

00:00:29.393 --> 00:00:30.194
until the end

00:00:30.006 --> 00:00:31.220
of 2026

00:00:31.386 --> 00:00:32.529
with a 14-day

00:00:32.341 --> 00:00:33.225
free trial

00:00:33.438 --> 00:00:34.310
after more than

00:00:34.122 --> 00:00:35.867
160 builds for

00:00:35.678 --> 00:00:37.671
250 beta testers

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:39.204
Full story on

00:00:39.015 --> 00:00:39.911
